VARA_3 ~~ VARA_3
VARA_4 ~~ VARA_4
VARB_1 ~~ VARB_1
VARB_2 ~~ VARB_2
VARB_3 ~~ VARB_3
VARB_4 ~~ VARB_4
"

Then, I try to test the model. However, when I used “lavaan” in the syntax, it shows different results compared with “growth” in the syntax.

